From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 07:01:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: gpu: img,powervr-rogue: Add the Allwinner A733
 GPU

The Allwinner A733 has an Imagination BXM-4-64 MC1 GPU. Add its SoC
compatible to the BXM-4-64 list.

It takes the generic clocks (core, mem, sys), one reset, one interrupt
and a single power domain, all within the existing constraints.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the node with this
compatible binds powervr with its core, mem and sys clocks, its reset,
its interrupt and one power domain.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml
index e9218e0f363d..3c658926300c 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@ properties:
           - const: img,img-rogue
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-gpu
               - thead,th1520-gpu
           - const: img,img-bxm-4-64
           - const: img,img-rogue
